{"version":1,"page":{"kind":"annotation-detail","href":"/shijing/annotation/107-ge-ju/fangyurun-yuanshi","dataHref":"/__data/shijing/annotation/107-ge-ju/fangyurun-yuanshi/data.json","title":"诗经原始(上下) · 葛屨 · 注释总览","description":"風 · 魏風 · 葛屨 · 汇集《诗经原始(上下)》关于《葛屨》的 5 条注释，含 5 条注脚。"},"payload":{"detail":{"route":{"poemId":"107-ge-ju","materialId":"fangyurun-yuanshi"},"href":"/shijing/annotation/107-ge-ju/fangyurun-yuanshi","poem":{"id":"107-ge-ju","title":"葛屨","categoryId":"feng","subcategoryId":"weifeng-state","path":["風","魏風","葛屨"],"segments":[{"id":"seg-001","text":"糾糾葛屨","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-002","text":"可以履霜","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-003","text":"摻摻女手","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-004","text":"可以縫裳","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-005","text":"要之襋之","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-006","text":"好人服之","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-007","text":"好人提提","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-008","text":"宛然左辟","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-009","text":"佩其象揥","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-010","text":"維是褊心","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-011","text":"是以爲刺","isActive":false}]},"material":{"id":"fangyurun-yuanshi","title":"诗经原始(上下)","authors":["方玉润","李先耕"],"contributorLine":"清 · 方玉润、李先耕","era":"清","publicationYear":1986,"carrier":"EPUB"},"stats":{"annotationCount":5,"glossCount":5},"annotations":[{"id":"0001","order":1,"total":5,"layer":"global","layerLabel":"全篇总说","targetText":"刺褊也。","targetNotes":"篇首题注。","sourceLabel":null,"sourceNotes":"对应 EPUB item 篇首题注。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0001-1","attributionLabel":"方玉润","sectionLabel":"题注"}]},{"id":"0002","order":2,"total":5,"layer":"global","layerLabel":"全篇总说","targetText":"右《葛屨》二章，一章六句，一章五句。儉，美德也，何可刺？然儉之過則必至於嗇，嗇之過則必至於褊。今不惟嗇，而又褊矣。故可刺。詩言本自分明，而《序》與《傳》乃混而釋之，致啟後人疑議。此不善説《詩》者過也。夫履霜以葛屨，縫裳以女手，若在士庶之家，亦何足異？惟以象揥之好人，爲而服之，則未免近於趨利，下與民同，其規模狹隘固不必言，而心術之鄙陋爲何如哉？故儉亦當有節焉，乃爲貴耳。","targetNotes":"总评原文。","sourceLabel":null,"sourceNotes":"对应 EPUB item 总评段。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0002-1","attributionLabel":"方玉润","sectionLabel":"总评"}]},{"id":"0003","order":3,"total":5,"layer":"global","layerLabel":"全篇总说","targetText":"明點作意，又是一法。","targetNotes":"眉评原文。","sourceLabel":null,"sourceNotes":"对应 EPUB item 眉评段。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0003-1","attributionLabel":"方玉润","sectionLabel":"眉評"}]},{"id":"0004","order":4,"total":5,"layer":"global","layerLabel":"全篇总说","targetText":"糾糾〔毛氏萇曰〕糾糾，猶繚繚也。葛屨〔《集傳》〕夏葛屨，冬皮屨。摻摻猶纖纖也。要裳要。襋衣領。好人〔《集傳》〕好人，猶大人也。〔黄氏佐曰〕猶今言大人不當親細事也。〔姚氏際恒曰〕好人猶美人，指夫人也，以見其服事之勤如此。亦通。提提安舒之意。宛然讓之貌也。左辟〔徐氏鳳彩曰〕古人以右爲尊，故讓者辟右就左，大人之儀容也。揥〔《集傳》〕揥，所以摘髮，用象骨爲之，貴者之飾也。","targetNotes":"集释原文。","sourceLabel":null,"sourceNotes":"对应 EPUB item 集释段。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0004-1","attributionLabel":"方玉润","sectionLabel":"集釋"}]},{"id":"0005","order":5,"total":5,"layer":"global","layerLabel":"全篇总说","targetText":"霜七陽。裳同。本韻。襋十三職。服一屋，叶蒲北反。叶韻。辟四寘。揥八霽。刺四寘。通韻。","targetNotes":"标韵原文。","sourceLabel":null,"sourceNotes":"对应 EPUB item 标韵段。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0005-1","attributionLabel":"方玉润","sectionLabel":"標韻"}]}]}}}
